# Through the Quicksand Caves (battlefield.through_the_quicksand_caves): the mission current at status 0.
# SC_Entrance opens the menu (32000, bit 1). Update option 0 answers nothing; option 81 (index 5, not offered)
# answers 5; option 1 (index 0, area 1) enters: ENTERING_THE_BATTLEFIELD_FOR (7609), the party and time
# lines (7543, 7546), the update (2, 0, 0, 1800). The three Centurio V-III of area 1 (by id +0 to +2) die:
# won, 32001. The finish is the mission's (mission.zilart.through_the_quicksand_caves): completed (The
# Chamber of Oracles current). Then the fight ends (0x075).
lists ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventUpdate/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32002 ChamberOfOracles/Shimmering_Circle/onTrigger
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves current
login
trigger SC_Entrance                     # the menu 32000 (bit 1)
update 32000 option=0                   # ignored
update 32000 option=81                  # index 5, not offered: 5
update 32000 option=1                   # index 0, area 1: entered
finish
tick 2000                               # placed in area 1
kill CENTURIO_V_III
kill CENTURIO_V_III+1
kill CENTURIO_V_III+2                   # all three dead: won, 32001
finish                                  # the mission's 32001: completed
tick 11000                              # the fight ends
tick 10000
